-- SAH-59 (ADR-022 D11, BR45-3) · Seed: the six starter forms of the mockup's #FormBuilder (window.__DC_SRC FormBuilder,
-- TEMPLATES: foot, gcs, morse, mlc, pac, blank). Reference data only; no patient data. Forward-only.
-- STARTER LIST, NOT CLINICALLY REVIEWED: names, fields, options, scores, ranges and bands are values from the EMR mockup,
-- accepted by the human in DEC-039, not clinically reviewed. The MLC form (mlc_injury) is tagged L-1 (medico-legal),
-- the scores and bands C-9.
-- Conversion of the mockup (rules, so a reviewer can check the JSON against the source):
--   * field type: text SHORT_TEXT, longtext LONG_TEXT, yesno YES_NO, single SINGLE_CHOICE, multi MULTI_CHOICE, vitals VITALS_BLOCK,
--     bodymap BODY_MAP, meds MEDICINE_LIST, icd DIAGNOSIS, labs LAB_TESTS, calc SCORE, band SCORE_BAND, section SECTION_HEADING,
--     note INFO_NOTE, sign SIGNATURE, photo PHOTO (the other types map by name). The mockup's id is the field key.
--   * option key = the label in lower case with runs of other characters made one underscore (cut at 40); YES_NO options are
--     yes and no. Option score = the number after the bar in the mockup (default 0).
--   * showIf {field, value} -> {fieldKey, optionKey}; rule op "<" -> NUMBER_BELOW, "count<" -> CHOSEN_COUNT_BELOW;
--     lo/hi -> normalFrom/normalTo; code -> standardCode; roles -> whoCanFill (DOCTOR, NURSE).
--   * settings: useIn from the mockup's dept list (General Medicine gm, Diabetology diab, Orthopaedics ortho, Surgery surgery,
--     Dental dental, Obstetrics & Gynaecology og; Emergency -> place EMERGENCY; IPD wards -> place IPD_WARD), emrPart ASSESSMENT
--     (the mockup's part), and the mockup's initial form settings for the rest (visit types New consult and Follow-up, filled
--     by Doctor and Nurse, English + Marathi, approval on).
-- Not in the mockup, so not stored: a Marathi or Hindi label of any field.

